"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nI enjoyed reading it so much. I thought, 'So you can read such a thick book this fast.'  \n\nThe composition where the protagonist, who lost his memory, and the reader, who knows nothing, start on the same line and gradually grasp the situation together was interesting and fun.  \n\nI think it's a work where the nerdiness of trying to think of everything through scientific reasoning and the author's scientific meticulousness stand out.  \n\nReaders who have read this book would have mobilized their imagination to create their own Rocky and imagined him saying .  \nMy own Rocky is very cute!!  \n\nIt's being made into a movie with a target release in 2026. "